CESSED\",\"manual_references\":[]},{\"title\":\"Nghi\\u1ec7p v\\u1ee5: Ch\\u1ea5m \\u0111i\\u1ec3m\",\"relation\":\"pending\",\"explanation\":\"H\\u1ec7 th\\u1ed1ng ch\\u01b0a t\\u00ecm \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c d\\u1eabn ch\\u1ee9ng ph\\u00f9 h\\u1ee3p; gi\\u1ea3ng vi\\u00ean vui l\\u00f2ng \\u0111\\u1ed1i chi\\u1ebfu b\\u00e1o c\\u00e1o g\\u1ed1c.\",\"source_references\":[],\"check_status\":\"NOT_PROCESSED\",\"manual_references\":[]},{\"title\":\"Nghi\\u1ec7p v\\u1ee5: N\\u1ed9p b\\u00e0i\",\"relation\":\"pending\",\"explanation\":\"H\\u1ec7 th\\u1ed1ng ch\\u01b0a t\\u00ecm \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c d\\u1eabn ch\\u1ee9ng ph\\u00f9 h\\u1ee3p; gi\\u1ea3ng vi\\u00ean vui l\\u00f2ng \\u0111\\u1ed1i chi\\u1ebfu b\\u00e1o c\\u00e1o g\\u1ed1c.\",\"source_references\":[],\"check_status\":\"NOT_PROCESSED\",\"manual_references\":[]}],\"report_matches\":[]}],\"requirements_document\":{\"fingerprint\":\"9bae9f5dbcfc25d8fee31e166eaac947b3da862067dcaf05af6682f3490dc89a\",\"title\":\"\\u0110\\u1ee3t 1 \\u2013 Kh\\u1ea3o s\\u00e1t v\\u00e0 m\\u00f4 t\\u1ea3 nghi\\u1ec7p v\\u1ee5\",\"period\":\"Giai \\u0111o\\u1ea1n 1 \\u2013 Kh\\u1ea3o s\\u00e1t, ph\\u00e2n t\\u00edch v\\u00e0 thi\\u1ebft k\\u1ebf h\\u1ec7 th\\u1ed1ng\",\"text\":\"Y\\u00eau c\\u1ea7u n\\u1ed9p b\\u00e1o c\\u00e1o:\\nN\\u1ed9p b\\u00e1o c\\u00e1o kh\\u1ea3o s\\u00e1t h\\u1ec7 th\\u1ed1ng qu\\u1ea3n l\\u00fd c\\u00f4ng t\\u00e1c kh\\u00f3a lu\\u1eadn t\\u1ed1t nghi\\u1ec7p, g\\u1ed3m:\\r\\n\\r\\n1. Tr\\u00ecnh b\\u00e0y c\\u01a1 c\\u1ea5u t\\u1ed5 ch\\u1ee9c v\\u00e0 vai tr\\u00f2 c\\u1ee7a Gi\\u00e1o v\\u1ee5, Gi\\u1ea3ng vi\\u00ean, Sinh vi\\u00ean, Tr\\u01b0\\u1edfng b\\u1ed9 m\\u00f4n v\\u00e0 Tr\\u01b0\\u1edfng khoa.\\r\\n2. M\\u00f4 t\\u1ea3 quy tr\\u00ecnh l\\u1eadp k\\u1ebf ho\\u1ea1ch h\\u1ecdc k\\u1ef3 kh\\u00f3a lu\\u1eadn v\\u00e0 qu\\u1ea3n l\\u00fd sinh vi\\u00ean \\u0111\\u1ee7 \\u0111i\\u1ec1u ki\\u1ec7n.\\r\\n3. M\\u00f4 t\\u1ea3 quy tr\\u00ecnh \\u0111\\u1ec1 xu\\u1ea5t, x\\u00e9t duy\\u1ec7t v\\u00e0 \\u0111\\u0103ng k\\u00fd \\u0111\\u1ec1 t\\u00e0i kh\\u00f3a lu\\u1eadn.\\r\\n4. M\\u00f4 t\\u1ea3 quy tr\\u00ecnh theo d\\u00f5i ti\\u1ebfn \\u0111\\u1ed9, qu\\u1ea3n l\\u00fd h\\u1ed3 s\\u01a1 b\\u1ea3o v\\u1ec7 v\\u00e0 t\\u1ed5 ch\\u1ee9c b\\u1ea3o v\\u1ec7 kh\\u00f3a lu\\u1eadn.\\r\\n5. X\\u00e1c \\u0111\\u1ecbnh nh\\u1eefng nghi\\u1ec7p v\\u1ee5 ch\\u00ednh m\\u00e0 h\\u1ec7 th\\u1ed1ng c\\u1ea7n h\\u1ed7 tr\\u1ee3.\\r\\n\\r\\nC\\u00e1c n\\u1ed9i dung ph\\u1ea3i \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c tr\\u00ecnh b\\u00e0y c\\u1ee5 th\\u1ec3 trong ph\\u1ea7n th\\u00e2n b\\u00e1o c\\u00e1o. Ch\\u01b0a y\\u00eau c\\u1ea7u s\\u01a1 \\u0111\\u1ed3 thi\\u1ebft k\\u1ebf ho\\u1eb7c m\\u00e3 ngu\\u1ed3n ho\\u00e0n ch\\u1ec9nh.\",\"sources\":[{\"source_id\":\"REQ-0001\",\"text\":\"Y\\u00eau c\\u1ea7u n\\u1ed9p b\\u00e1o c\\u00e1o:\\nN\\u1ed9p b\\u00e1o c\\u00e1o kh\\u1ea3o s\\u00e1t h\\u1ec7 th\\u1ed1ng qu\\u1ea3n l\\u00fd c\\u00f4ng t\\u00e1c kh\\u00f3a lu\\u1eadn t\\u1ed1t nghi\\u1ec7p, g\\u1ed3m:\\r\\n\\r\\n1. Tr\\u00ecnh b\\u00e0y c\\u01a1 c\\u1ea5u t\\u1ed5 ch\\u1ee9c v\\u00e0 vai tr\\u00f2 c\\u1ee7a Gi\\u00e1o v\\u1ee5, Gi\\u1ea3ng vi\\u00ean, Sinh vi\\u00ean, Tr\\u01b0\\u1edfng b\\u1ed9 m\\u00f4n v\\u00e0 Tr\\u01b0\\u1edfng khoa.\\r\\n2. M\\u00f4 t\\u1ea3 quy tr\\u00ecnh l\\u1eadp k\\u1ebf ho\\u1ea1ch h\\u1ecdc k\\u1ef3 kh\\u00f3a lu\\u1eadn v\\u00e0 qu\\u1ea3n l\\u00fd sinh vi\\u00ean \\u0111\\u1ee7 \\u0111i\\u1ec1u ki\\u1ec7n.\\r\\n3. M\\u00f4 t\\u1ea3 quy tr\\u00ecnh \\u0111\\u1ec1 xu\\u1ea5t, x\\u00e9t duy\\u1ec7t v\\u00e0 \\u0111\\u0103ng k\\u00fd \\u0111\\u1ec1 t\\u00e0i kh\\u00f3a lu\\u1eadn.\\r\\n4. M\\u00f4 t\\u1ea3 quy tr\\u00ecnh theo d\\u00f5i ti\\u1ebfn \\u0111\\u1ed9, qu\\u1ea3n l\\u00fd h\\u1ed3 s\\u01a1 b\\u1ea3o v\\u1ec7 v\\u00e0 t\\u1ed5 ch\\u1ee9c b\\u1ea3o v\\u1ec7 kh\\u00f3a lu\\u1eadn.\\r\\n5. X\\u00e1c \\u0111\\u1ecbnh nh\\u1eefng nghi\\u1ec7p v\\u1ee5 ch\\u00ednh m\\u00e0 h\\u1ec7 th\\u1ed1ng c\\u1ea7n h\\u1ed7 tr\\u1ee3.\\r\\n\\r\\nC\\u00e1c n\\u1ed9i dung ph\\u1ea3i \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c tr\\u00ecnh b\\u00e0y c\\u1ee5 th\\u1ec3 trong ph\\u1ea7n th\\u00e2n b\\u00e1o c\\u00e1o. Ch\\u01b0a y\\u00eau c\\u1ea7u s\\u01a1 \\u0111\\u1ed3 thi\\u1ebft k\\u1ebf ho\\u1eb7c m\\u00e3 ngu\\u1ed3n ho\\u00e0n ch\\u1ec9nh.\",\"start\":0,\"end\":624,\"start_page\":null,\"end_page\":null}],\"kind\":\"text\"},\"teacher_requirements_status\":\"provided\",\"requirements_links_status\":\"partial\",\"_submission_identity\":{\"group_id\":\"N02\",\"semester_id\":\"HK2627_1\",\"topic_id\":\"DT27\",\"stage_id\":1,\"round_id\":1},\"_analysis_history\":{\"c5db74c71a55975c908ecd2ff040b68e50a24f863488ea6b9704d137b5bd7abb\":{\"id\":\"c5db74c71a55975c908ecd2ff040b68e50a24f863488ea6b9704d137b5bd7abb\",\"schema_version\":6,\"source_hash\":\"44a3076b92d7f139139e29987b89857eebbbae2cb67bd5d797719fdeeddbf3f0\"},\"2bc078f85e8aad0eb92914ab3c6ed4ccbafee2aea8406f49b3102f89a071ba68\":{\"id\":\"2bc078f85e8aad0eb92914ab3c6ed4ccbafee2aea8406f49b3102f89a071ba68\",\"schema_version\":6,\"source_hash\":\"44a3076b92d7f139139e29987b89857eebbbae2cb67bd5d797719fdeeddbf3f0\"},\"491f4a1478b758888761d876504e1f201d1005d057392f441432692d12dd7637\":{\"id\":\"491f4a1478b758888761d876504e1f201d1005d057392f441432692d12dd7637\",\"schema_version\":6,\"source_hash\":\"44a3076b92d7f139139e29987b89857eebbbae2cb67bd5d797719fdeeddbf3f0\"},\"5c8552742456bb40326abda35544c0445b9856700989ddcc9304309369ba57a6\":{\"id\":\"5c8552742456bb40326abda35544c0445b9856700989ddcc9304309369ba57a6\",\"schema_version\":6,\"source_hash\":\"44a3076b92d7f139139e29987b89857eebbbae2cb67bd5d797719fdeeddbf3f0\"},\"88a5629242057f430ee293a5d08b5aa07788c8ecc0bc1ff09dd5218c761798c2\":{\"id\":\"88a5629242057f430ee293a5d08b5aa07788c8ecc0bc1ff09dd5218c761798c2\",\"schema_version\":6,\"source_hash\":\"44a3076b92d7f139139e29987b89857eebbbae2cb67bd5d797719fdeeddbf3f0\"},\"b0d04b6acb4e7c4382414d3f8b57960247cf090231268e0cd8cd9d9e075ffc4f\":{\"id\":\"b0d04b6acb4e7c4382414d3f8b57960247cf090231268e0cd8cd9d9e075ffc4f\",\"sche