b8-l0\",\"page\":23,\"end_page\":23,\"quote\":\"- Actor ch\\u00ednh:Qu\\u1ea3n tr\\u1ecb, gi\\u00e1o v\\u1ee5, gi\\u1ea3ng vi\\u00ean, sinh vi\\u00ean\",\"start\":27551,\"end\":27605,\"char_ranges\":[{\"char_start\":27551,\"char_end\":27605,\"page_number\":23,\"page_index\":22,\"line_id\":\"p23-b8-l0\"}],\"quote_verified\":true,\"semantic_support\":\"PARTIAL\",\"document_sha256\":\"44a3076b92d7f139139e29987b89857eebbbae2cb67bd5d797719fdeeddbf3f0\"},{\"source_id\":\"44a3076b92d7:p25:text_block:p25-b26-l0-p25-b26-l0\",\"page\":25,\"end_page\":25,\"quote\":\"- Actor ch\\u00ednh: Gi\\u00e1o v\\u1ee5\",\"start\":29709,\"end\":29731,\"char_ranges\":[{\"char_start\":29709,\"char_end\":29731,\"page_number\":25,\"page_index\":24,\"line_id\":\"p25-b26-l0\"}],\"quote_verified\":true,\"semantic_support\":\"PARTIAL\",\"document_sha256\":\"44a3076b92d7f139139e29987b89857eebbbae2cb67bd5d797719fdeeddbf3f0\"}],\"check_status\":\"PARTIAL\",\"manual_references\":[]},{\"title\":\"Tr\\u00ecnh b\\u00e0y vai tr\\u00f2 c\\u1ee7a Gi\\u00e1o v\\u1ee5, Gi\\u1ea3ng vi\\u00ean, Sinh vi\\u00ean, Tr\\u01b0\\u1edfng b\\u1ed9 m\\u00f4n v\\u00e0 Tr\\u01b0\\u1edfng khoa\",\"relation\":\"not_found\",\"explanation\":\"H\\u1ec7 th\\u1ed1ng ch\\u01b0a t\\u00ecm \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c d\\u1eabn ch\\u1ee9ng ph\\u00f9 h\\u1ee3p; gi\\u1ea3ng vi\\u00ean vui l\\u00f2ng \\u0111\\u1ed1i chi\\u1ebfu b\\u00e1o c\\u00e1o g\\u1ed1c.\",\"source_references\":[],\"check_status\":\"NO_VERIFIED_EVIDENCE\",\"manual_references\":[]}],\"report_matches\":[]},{\"requirement_id\":\"req_002\",\"text\":\"2. M\\u00f4 t\\u1ea3 quy tr\\u00ecnh l\\u1eadp k\\u1ebf ho\\u1ea1ch h\\u1ecdc k\\u1ef3 kh\\u00f3a lu\\u1eadn v\\u00e0 qu\\u1ea3n l\\u00fd sinh vi\\u00ean \\u0111\\u1ee7 \\u0111i\\u1ec1u ki\\u1ec7n.\",\"evidence_quote\":\"2. M\\u00f4 t\\u1ea3 quy tr\\u00ecnh l\\u1eadp k\\u1ebf ho\\u1ea1ch h\\u1ecdc k\\u1ef3 kh\\u00f3a lu\\u1eadn v\\u00e0 qu\\u1ea3n l\\u00fd sinh vi\\u00ean \\u0111\\u1ee7 \\u0111i\\u1ec1u ki\\u1ec7n.\",\"report_relation\":\"not_found\",\"report_explanation\":\"Ch\\u01b0a \\u0111\\u1ee7 d\\u1eabn ch\\u1ee9ng \\u0111\\u1ec3 k\\u1ebft lu\\u1eadn; gi\\u1ea3ng vi\\u00ean vui l\\u00f2ng \\u0111\\u1ed1i chi\\u1ebfu b\\u00e1o c\\u00e1o g\\u1ed1c.\",\"report_points\":[{\"title\":\"M\\u00f4 t\\u1ea3 quy tr\\u00ecnh l\\u1eadp k\\u1ebf ho\\u1ea1ch h\\u1ecdc k\\u1ef3 kh\\u00f3a lu\\u1eadn\",\"relation\":\"not_found\",\"explanation\":\"H\\u1ec7 th\\u1ed1ng ch\\u01b0a t\\u00ecm \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c d\\u1eabn ch\\u1ee9ng ph\\u00f9 h\\u1ee3p; gi\\u1ea3ng vi\\u00ean vui l\\u00f2ng \\u0111\\u1ed1i chi\\u1ebfu b\\u00e1o c\\u00e1o g\\u1ed1c.\",\"source_references\":[],\"check_status\":\"NO_VERIFIED_EVIDENCE\",\"manual_references\":[]},{\"title\":\"M\\u00f4 t\\u1ea3 quy tr\\u00ecnh qu\\u1ea3n l\\u00fd sinh vi\\u00ean \\u0111\\u1ee7 \\u0111i\\u1ec1u ki\\u1ec7n\",\"relation\":\"not_found\",\"explanation\":\"H\\u1ec7 th\\u1ed1ng ch\\u01b0a t\\u00ecm \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c d\\u1eabn ch\\u1ee9ng ph\\u00f9 h\\u1ee3p; gi\\u1ea3ng vi\\u00ean vui l\\u00f2ng \\u0111\\u1ed1i chi\\u1ebfu b\\u00e1o c\\u00e1o g\\u1ed1c.\",\"source_references\":[],\"check_status\":\"NO_VERIFIED_EVIDENCE\",\"manual_references\":[]}],\"report_matches\":[]},{\"requirement_id\":\"req_003\",\"text\":\"3. M\\u00f4 t\\u1ea3 quy tr\\u00ecnh \\u0111\\u1ec1 xu\\u1ea5t, x\\u00e9t duy\\u1ec7t v\\u00e0 \\u0111\\u0103ng k\\u00fd \\u0111\\u1ec1 t\\u00e0i kh\\u00f3a lu\\u1eadn.\",\"evidence_quote\":\"3. M\\u00f4 t\\u1ea3 quy tr\\u00ecnh \\u0111\\u1ec1 xu\\u1ea5t, x\\u00e9t duy\\u1ec7t v\\u00e0 \\u0111\\u0103ng k\\u00fd \\u0111\\u1ec1 t\\u00e0i kh\\u00f3a lu\\u1eadn.\",\"report_relation\":\"related_text\",\"report_explanation\":\"T\\u00e0i li\\u1ec7u c\\u00f3 m\\u00f4 t\\u1ea3 c\\u00e1c b\\u01b0\\u1edbc trong lu\\u1ed3ng ho\\u1ea1t \\u0111\\u1ed9ng ch\\u00ednh c\\u1ee7a vi\\u1ec7c t\\u1ea1o v\\u00e0 qu\\u1ea3n l\\u00fd kh\\u00f3a lu\\u1eadn. T\\u00e0i li\\u1ec7u \\u0111\\u1ec1 c\\u1eadp \\u0111\\u1ebfn ch\\u1ee9c n\\u0103ng duy\\u1ec7t kh\\u00f3a lu\\u1eadn c\\u1ee7a gi\\u1ea3ng vi\\u00ean. C\\u00f3 th\\u00eam 1 ti\\u00eau ch\\u00ed c\\u00f3 ngu\\u1ed3n \\u1edf ph\\u1ea7n chi ti\\u1ebft. C\\u1ea7n ki\\u1ec3m tra th\\u00eam: M\\u00f4 t\\u1ea3 quy tr\\u00ecnh x\\u00e9t duy\\u1ec7t \\u0111\\u1ec1 t\\u00e0i kh\\u00f3a lu\\u1eadn, M\\u00f4 t\\u1ea3 quy tr\\u00ecnh \\u0111\\u0103ng k\\u00fd \\u0111\\u1ec1 t\\u00e0i kh\\u00f3a lu\\u1eadn.\",\"report_points\":[{\"title\":\"M\\u00f4 t\\u1ea3 quy tr\\u00ecnh \\u0111\\u1ec1 xu\\u1ea5t \\u0111\\u1ec1 t\\u00e0i kh\\u00f3a lu\\u1eadn\",\"relation\":\"related_text\",\"explanation\":\"T\\u00e0i li\\u1ec7u c\\u00f3 m\\u00f4 t\\u1ea3 c\\u00e1c b\\u01b0\\u1edbc trong lu\\u1ed3ng ho\\u1ea1t \\u0111\\u1ed9ng ch\\u00ednh c\\u1ee7a vi\\u1ec7c t\\u1ea1o v\\u00e0 qu\\u1ea3n l\\u00fd kh\\u00f3a lu\\u1eadn.\",\"source_references\":[{\"source_id\":\"44a3076b92d7:p26:usecase_field:p26-b4-l0-p26-b13-l0\",\"page\":26,\"end_page\":26,\"quote\":\"- Lu\\u1ed3ng ho\\u1ea1t \\u0111\\u1ed9ng ch\\u00ednh:\\n1. \\u0110\\u0103ng nh\\u1eadp th\\u00e0nh c\\u00f4ng\\n2. Ch\\u1ecdn Qu\\u1ea3n l\\u00fd kh\\u00f3a lu\\u1eadn\\n3. Ch\\u1ecdn th\\u00eam kh\\u00f3a lu\\u1eadn\\n4. Th\\u00eam t\\u00ean kh\\u00f3a lu\\u1eadn, kh\\u00f3a lu\\u1eadn thu\\u1ed9c khoa n\\u00e0o\\n5. L\\u01b0u kh\\u00f3a lu\\u1eadn\\n6. Ch\\u1ecdn kh\\u00f3a lu\\u1eadn v\\u1eeba t\\u1ea1o\\n7. Th\\u00eam gi\\u1ea3ng vi\\u00ean, sinh vi\\u00ean v\\u00e0o kh\\u00f3a lu\\u1eadn\\n8. Ch\\u1ecdn xem chi ti\\u1ebft kh\\u00f3a lu\\u1eadn\\n9. Ti\\u1ebfn h\\u00e0nh th\\u00eam, s\\u1eeda, x\\u00f3a khi c\\u1ea7n thi\\u1ebft\",\"start\":29880,\"end\":30185,\"char_ranges\":[{\"char_start\":29880,\"char_end\":29904,\"page_number\":26,\"page_index\":25,\"line_id\":\"p26-b4-l0\"},{\"char_start\":29905,\"char_end\":29928,\"page_number\":26,\"page_index\":25,\"line_id\":\"p26-b5-l0\"},{\"char_start\":29929,\"char_end\":29954,\"page_number\":26,\"page_index\":25,\"line_id\":\"p26-b6-l0\"},{\"char_start\":29955,\"char_end\":29977,\"page_numbe