 v\\u00e0 th\\u00eam c\\u00e1c th\\u00e0nh vi\\u00ean.\",\"source_references\":[{\"source_id\":\"44a3076b92d7:p27:usecase_field:p27-b4-l0-p27-b12-l0\",\"page\":27,\"end_page\":27,\"quote\":\"- Lu\\u1ed3ng ho\\u1ea1t \\u0111\\u1ed9ng ch\\u00ednh:\\n1. \\u0110\\u0103ng nh\\u1eadp th\\u00e0nh c\\u00f4ng\\n2. Ch\\u1ecdn ch\\u1ee9c n\\u0103ng th\\u00eam h\\u1ed9i \\u0111\\u1ed3ng\\n3. Ti\\u1ebfn h\\u00e0nh th\\u00eam t\\u00ean h\\u1ed9i \\u0111\\u1ed3ng\\n4. L\\u01b0u h\\u1ed9i \\u0111\\u1ed3ng\\n5. Ch\\u1ecdn h\\u1ed9i \\u0111\\u1ed3ng v\\u1eeba t\\u1ea1o\\n6. Th\\u00eam Ch\\u1ee7t\\u1ecbch, Th\\u01b0 k\\u00fd, Gi\\u00e1o vi\\u00ean ph\\u1ea3n bi\\u1ec7n, th\\u00e0nh vi\\u00ean n\\u1ebfu c\\u00f3\\n7. Ch\\u1ecdn xem chi ti\\u1ebft t\\u1eebng kh\\u00f3a lu\\u1eadn\\n8. Ti\\u1ebfn h\\u00e0nh s\\u1eeda, x\\u00f3a, th\\u00eam th\\u00f4ng tin v\\u1ec1H\\u1ed9i \\u0111\\u1ed3ng khi c\\u1ea7n thi\\u1ebft\",\"start\":30811,\"end\":31126,\"char_ranges\":[{\"char_start\":30811,\"char_end\":30835,\"page_number\":27,\"page_index\":26,\"line_id\":\"p27-b4-l0\"},{\"char_start\":30836,\"char_end\":30859,\"page_number\":27,\"page_index\":26,\"line_id\":\"p27-b5-l0\"},{\"char_start\":30860,\"char_end\":30891,\"page_number\":27,\"page_index\":26,\"line_id\":\"p27-b6-l0\"},{\"char_start\":30892,\"char_end\":30922,\"page_number\":27,\"page_index\":26,\"line_id\":\"p27-b7-l0\"},{\"char_start\":30923,\"char_end\":30938,\"page_number\":27,\"page_index\":26,\"line_id\":\"p27-b8-l0\"},{\"char_start\":30939,\"char_end\":30963,\"page_number\":27,\"page_index\":26,\"line_id\":\"p27-b9-l0\"},{\"char_start\":30964,\"char_end\":31027,\"page_number\":27,\"page_index\":26,\"line_id\":\"p27-b10-l0\"},{\"char_start\":31028,\"char_end\":31063,\"page_number\":27,\"page_index\":26,\"line_id\":\"p27-b11-l0\"},{\"char_start\":31064,\"char_end\":31126,\"page_number\":27,\"page_index\":26,\"line_id\":\"p27-b12-l0\"}],\"quote_verified\":true,\"semantic_support\":\"SUPPORTS\",\"document_sha256\":\"44a3076b92d7f139139e29987b89857eebbbae2cb67bd5d797719fdeeddbf3f0\"}],\"check_status\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"manual_references\":[]},{\"title\":\"Nghi\\u1ec7p v\\u1ee5: T\\u1ea1o ti\\u00eau ch\\u00ed ch\\u1ea5m \\u0111i\\u1ec3m kh\\u00f3a lu\\u1eadn\",\"relation\":\"related_text\",\"explanation\":\"T\\u00e0i li\\u1ec7u c\\u00f3 \\u0111\\u1ec1 c\\u1eadp \\u0111\\u1ebfn actor v\\u00e0 m\\u00f4 t\\u1ea3 v\\u1eafn t\\u1eaft c\\u1ee7a nghi\\u1ec7p v\\u1ee5 t\\u1ea1o ti\\u00eau ch\\u00ed ch\\u1ea5m \\u0111i\\u1ec3m kh\\u00f3a lu\\u1eadn, tuy nhi\\u00ean ch\\u01b0a tr\\u00ecnh b\\u00e0y \\u0111\\u1ea7y \\u0111\\u1ee7 c\\u00e1c lu\\u1ed3ng ho\\u1ea1t \\u0111\\u1ed9ng chi ti\\u1ebft.\",\"source_references\":[{\"source_id\":\"44a3076b92d7:p27:text_block:p27-b23-l0-p27-b23-l0\",\"page\":27,\"end_page\":27,\"quote\":\"- Actor ch\\u00ednh: Gi\\u00e1o v\\u1ee5\",\"start\":31699,\"end\":31721,\"char_ranges\":[{\"char_start\":31699,\"char_end\":31721,\"page_number\":27,\"page_index\":26,\"line_id\":\"p27-b23-l0\"}],\"quote_verified\":true,\"semantic_support\":\"PARTIAL\",\"document_sha256\":\"44a3076b92d7f139139e29987b89857eebbbae2cb67bd5d797719fdeeddbf3f0\"},{\"source_id\":\"44a3076b92d7:p27:usecase_field:p27-b21-l0-p27-b22-l0\",\"page\":27,\"end_page\":27,\"quote\":\"- M\\u00f4 t\\u1ea3v\\u1eafn t\\u1eaft use case: gi\\u00e1o v\\u1ee5\\u0111\\u0103ng nh\\u1eadp v\\u00e0o h\\u1ec7th\\u1ed1ng, ch\\u1ecdn ch\\u1ee9c n\\u0103ng T\\u1ea1o\\nti\\u00eau ch\\u00ed ch\\u1ea5m \\u0111i\\u1ec3m kh\\u00f3a lu\\u1eadn\",\"start\":31596,\"end\":31698,\"char_ranges\":[{\"char_start\":31596,\"char_end\":31669,\"page_number\":27,\"page_index\":26,\"line_id\":\"p27-b21-l0\"},{\"char_start\":31670,\"char_end\":31698,\"page_number\":27,\"page_index\":26,\"line_id\":\"p27-b22-l0\"}],\"quote_verified\":true,\"semantic_support\":\"PARTIAL\",\"document_sha256\":\"44a3076b92d7f139139e29987b89857eebbbae2cb67bd5d797719fdeeddbf3f0\"}],\"check_status\":\"PARTIAL\",\"manual_references\":[]},{\"title\":\"Nghi\\u1ec7p v\\u1ee5: Ch\\u1ea5m \\u0111i\\u1ec3m\",\"relation\":\"related_text\",\"explanation\":\"T\\u00e0i li\\u1ec7u \\u0111\\u1eb7c t\\u1ea3 use case Ch\\u1ea5m \\u0111i\\u1ec3m cho gi\\u1ea3ng vi\\u00ean v\\u1edbi c\\u00e1c lu\\u1ed3ng ho\\u1ea1t \\u0111\\u1ed9ng c\\u1ee5 th\\u1ec3.\",\"source_references\":[{\"source_id\":\"44a3076b92d7:p28:text_block:p28-b16-l0-p28-b16-l0\",\"page\":28,\"end_page\":28,\"quote\":\"- Actor ch\\u00ednh: Gi\\u1ea3ng vi\\u00ean\",\"start\":32304,\"end\":32329,\"char_ranges\":[{\"char_start\":32304,\"char_end\":32329,\"page_number\":28,\"page_index\":27,\"line_id\":\"p28-b16-l0\"}],\"quote_verified\":true,\"semantic_support\":\"SUPPORTS\",\"document_sha256\":\"44a3076b92d7f139139e29987b89857eebbbae2cb67bd5d797719fdeeddbf3f0\"},{\"source_id\":\"44a3076b92d7:p28:usecase_field:p28-b21-l0-p28-b25-l0\",\"page\":28,\"end_page\":28,\"quote\":\"- Lu\\u1ed3ng ho\\u1ea1t \\u0111\\u1ed9ng ch\\u00ednh:\\n1. \\u0110\\u0103ng nh\\u1eadp th\\u00e0nh c\\u00f4ng\\n2. Ch\\u1ecdn kh\\u00f3a lu\\u1eadn c\\u1ea7n ch\\u1ea5m \\u0111i\\u1ec3m\\n3. Ti\\u1ebfn h\\u00e0nh th\\u00eam \\u0111i\\u1ec3m cho kh\\u00f3a lu\\u1eadn\\n4. L\\u01b0u \\u0111i\\u1ec3m\",\"start\":32546,\"end\":32675,\"char_ranges\":[{\"char_start\":32546,\"char_end\":32570,\"page_number\":28,\"page_index\":27,\"line_id\":\"p28-b21-l0\"},{\"char_start\":32571,\"char_end\":32594,\"page_number\":28,\"page_index\":27,\"line_id\":\"p28-b22-l0\"},{\"char_start\":32595,\"char_end\":32626,\"page_number\":28,\"page_index\":27,\"line_id\":\"p28-b23-l0\"},{\"char_start\":32627,\"char_end\":32663,\"page_number\":28,\"page_index\":27,\"line_id\":\"p28-b24-l0\"},{\"char_start\":32664,\"char_end\":32675,\"page_number\":28,\"page_index\":27,\"line_id\":\"p28-b25-l0\"}],\"quote_verified\":true,\"semantic_support\":\"SUPPORTS\",\"document_sha256\":\"44a3076b92d7f139139e29987b89857eebbbae2cb67bd5d797719fdeeddbf3f0\"}],\"check_status\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"manual_references\":[]},{\"title\":\"Nghi\\u1ec7p v\\u1ee5: N\\u1ed9p b\\u00e0i\",\"relation\":\"related_text\",\"explanation\":\"T\\u00e0i li\\u1ec7u \\u0111\\u1eb7c t\\u1ea3 use case N\\u1ed9p b\\u00e0i d\\u00e0nh cho sinh vi\\u00ean v\\u1edbi c\\u00e1c b\\u01b0\\u1edbc th\\u1ef1c hi\\u1ec7n.\",\"source_references\":[{\"source_id\":\"44a3076b92d7:p29:text_block:p29-b10-l0-p29-b10-l0\",\"page\":29,\"end_page\":29,\"quote\":\"- Actor ch\\u00ednh: Sinh vi\\u00ean\",\"start\":33058,\"end\":33082,\"char_ranges\":[{\"char_start\":33058,\"char_end\":33082,\"page_number\":29,\"page_index\":28,\"line_id\":\"p29-b10-l0\"}],\"quote_verified\":true,\"semantic_support\":\"SUPPORTS\",\"document_sha256\":\"44a3076b92d7f139139e29987b89857eebbbae2cb67bd5d797719fdeeddbf3f0\"},{\"source_id\":\"44a3076b92d7:p29:usecase_field:p29-b14-l0-p29-b19-l0\",\"page\":29,\"end_page\":29,\"quote\":\"- Lu\\u1ed3ng ho\\u1ea1t \\u0111\\u1ed9ng ch\\u00ednh:\\n1. \\u0110\\u0103ng nh\\u1eadp th\\u00e0nh c\\u00f4ng\\n2. Ch\\u1ecdn n\\u1ed9p b\\u00e0i\\n3. Ti\\u1ebfn h\\u00e0nh th\\u00eam file b\\u00e0i t\\u1eadp cho kh\\u00f3a lu\\u1eadn\\n4. L\\u01b0u b\\u00e0i\\n5. C\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3c\\u1eadp nh\\u1eadt b\\u00e0i n\\u1ebfu h\\u1ed9i \\u0111\\u1ed3ng ch\\u01b0a b\\u1eaft \\u0111\\u1ea7u ch\\u1ea5m \\u0111i\\u1ec3m\",\"start\":33252,\"end\":33430,\"char_ranges\":[{\"char_start\":33252,\"char_end\":33276,\"page_number\":29,\"page_index\":28,\"line_id\":\"p29-b14-l0\"},{\"char_start\":33277,\"char_end\":33300,\"page_number\":29,\"page_index\":28,\"line_id\":\"p29-b15-l0\"},{\"char_start\":33301,\"char_end\":33316,\"page_number\":29,\"page_index\":28,\"line_id\":\"p29-b16-l0\"},{\"char_start\":33317,\"char_end\":33361,\"page_number\":29,\"page_index\":28,\"line_id\":\"p29-b17-l0\"},{\"char_start\":33362,\"char_end\":33372,\"page_number\":29,\"page_index\":28,\"line_id\":\"p29-b18-l0\"},{\"char_start\":33373,\"char_end\":33430,\"page_number\":29,\"page_index\":28,\"line_id\":\"p29-b19-l0\"}],\"quote_verified\":true,\"semantic_support\":\"SUPPORTS\",\"document_sha256\":\"44a3076b92d7f139139e29987b89857eebbbae2cb67bd5d797719fdeeddbf3f0\"}],\"check_status\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"manual_references\":[]}],\"report_matches\":[]}],\"requirements_document\":{\"fingerprint\":\"9bae9f5dbcfc25d8fee31e166eaac947b3da862067dcaf05af6682f3490dc89a\",\"title\":\"\\u0110\\u1ee3t 1 \\u2013 Kh\\u1ea3o s\\u00e1t v\\u00e0 m\\u00f4 t\\u1ea3 nghi\\u1ec7p v\\u1ee5\",\"period\":\"Giai \\u0111o\\u1ea1n 1 \\u2013 Kh\\u1ea3o s\\u00e1t, ph\\u00e2n t\\u00edch v\\u00e0 thi\\u1ebft k\\u1ebf h\\u1ec7 th\\u1ed1ng\",\"text\":\"Y\\u00eau c\\u1ea7u n\\u1ed9p b\\u00e1o c\\u00e1o:\\nN\\u1ed9p b\\u00e1o c\\u00e1o kh\\u1ea3o s\\u00e1t h\\u1ec7 th\\u1ed1ng qu\\u1ea3n l\\u00fd c\\u00f4ng t\\u00e1c kh\\u00f3a lu\\u1eadn t\\u1ed1t nghi\\u1ec7p, g\\u1ed3m:\\r\\n\\r\\n1. Tr\\u00ecnh b\\u00e0y c\\u01a1 c\\u1ea5u t\\u1ed5 ch\\u1ee9c v\\u00e0 vai tr\\u00f2 c\\u1ee7a Gi\\u00e1o v\\u1ee5, Gi\\u1ea3ng vi\\u00ean, Sinh vi\\u00ean, Tr\\u01b0\\u1edfng b\\u1ed9 m\\u00f4n v\\u00e0 Tr\\u01b0\\u1edfng khoa.\\r\\n2. M\\u00f4 t\\u1ea3 quy tr\\u00ecnh l\\u1eadp k\\u1ebf ho\\u1ea1ch h\\u1ecdc k\\u1ef3 kh\\u00f3a lu\\u1eadn v\\u00e0 qu\\u1ea3n l\\u00fd sinh vi\\u00ean \\u0111\\u1ee7 \\u0111i\\u1ec1u ki\\u1ec7n.\\r\\n3. M\\u00f4 t\\u1ea3 quy tr\\u00ecnh \\u0111\\u1ec1 xu\\u1ea5t, x\\u00e9t duy\\u1ec7t v\\u00e0 \\u0111\\u0103ng k\\u00fd \\u0111\\u1ec1 t\\u00e0i kh\\u00f3a lu\\u1eadn.\\r\\n4. M\\u00f4 t\\u1ea3 quy tr\\u00ecnh theo d\\u00f5i ti\\u1ebfn \\u0111\\u1ed9, qu\\u1ea3n l\\u00fd h\\u1ed3 s\\u01a1 b\\u1ea3o v\\u1ec7 v\\u00e0 t\\u1ed5 ch\\u1ee9c b\\u1ea3o v\\u1ec7 kh\\u00f3a lu\\u1eadn.\\r\\n5. X\\u00e1c \\u0111\\u1ecbnh nh\\u1eefng nghi\\u1ec7p v\\u1ee5 ch\\u00ednh m\\u00e0 h\\u1ec7 th\\u1ed1ng c\\u1ea7n h\\u1ed7 tr\\u1ee3.\\r\\n\\r\\nC\\u00e1c n\\u1ed9i dung ph\\u1ea3i \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c tr\\u00ecnh b\\u00e0y c\\u1ee5 th\\u1ec3 trong ph\\u1ea7n th\\u00e2n b\\u00e1o c\\u00e1o. Ch\\u01b0a y\\u00eau c\\u1ea7u s\\u01a1 \\u0111\\u1ed3 thi\\u1ebft k\\u1ebf ho\\u1eb7c m\\u00e3 ngu\\u1ed3n ho\\u00e0n ch\\u1ec9nh.\",\"sources\":[{\"source_id\":\"REQ-0001\",\"text\":\"Y\\u00eau c\\u1ea7u n\\u1ed9p b\\u00e1o c\\u00e1o:\\nN\\u1ed9p b\\u00e1o c\\u00e1o kh\\u1ea3o s\\u00e1t h\\u1ec7 th\\u1ed1ng qu\\u1ea3n l\\u00fd c\\u00f4ng t\\u00e1c kh\\u00f3a lu\\u1eadn t\\u1ed1t nghi\\u1ec7p, g\\u1ed3m:\\r\\n\\r\\n1. Tr\\u00ecnh b\\u00e0y c\\u01a1 c\\u1ea5u t\\u1ed5 ch\\u1ee9c v\\u00e0 vai tr\\u00f2 c\\u1ee7a Gi\\u00e1o v\\u1ee5, Gi\\u1ea3ng vi\\u00ean, Sinh vi\\u00ean, Tr\\u01b0\\u1edfng b\\u1ed9 m\\u00f4n v\\u00e0 Tr\\u01b0\\u1edfng khoa.\\r\\n2. M\\u00f4 t\\u1ea3 quy tr\\u00ecnh l\\u1eadp k\\u1ebf ho\\u1ea1ch h\\u1ecdc k\\u1ef3 kh\\u00f3a lu\\u1eadn v\\u00e0 qu\\u1ea3n l\\u00fd sinh vi\\u00ean \\u0111\\u1ee7 \\u0111i\\u1ec1u ki\\u1ec7n.\\r\\n3. M\\u00f4 t\\u1ea3 quy tr\\u00ecnh \\u0111\\u1ec1 xu\\u1ea5t, x\\u00e9t duy\\u1ec7t v\\u00e0 \\u0111\\u0103ng k\\u00fd \\u0111\\u1ec1 t\\u00e0i kh\\u00f3a lu\\u1eadn.\\r\\n4. M\\u00f4 t\\u1ea3 quy tr\\u00ecnh theo d\\u00f5i ti\\u1ebfn \\u0111\\u1ed9, qu\\u1ea3n l\\u00fd h\\u1ed3 s\\u01a1 b\\u1ea3o v\\u1ec7 v\\u00e0 t\\u1ed5 ch\\u1ee9c b\\u1ea3o v\\u1ec7 kh\\u00f3a lu\\u1eadn.\\r\\n5. X\\u00e1c \\u0111\\u1ecbnh nh\\u1eefng nghi\\u1ec7p v\\u1ee5 ch\\u00ednh m\\u00e0 h\\u1ec7 th\\u1ed1ng c\\u1ea7n h\\u1ed7 tr\\u1ee3.\\r\\n\\r\\nC\\u00e1c n\\u1ed9i dung ph\\u1ea3i \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c tr\\u00ecnh b\\u00e0y c\\u1ee5 th\\u1ec3 trong ph\\u1ea7n th\\u00e2n b\\u00e1o c\\u00e1o. Ch\\u01b0a y\\u00eau c\\u1ea7u s\\u01a1 \\u0111\\u1ed3 thi\\u1ebft k\\u1ebf ho\\u1eb7c m\\u00e3 ngu\\u1ed3n ho\\u00e0n ch\\u1ec9nh.\",\"start\":0,\"end\":624,\"start_page\":null,\"end_page\":null}],\"kind\":\"text\"},\"teacher_requirements_status\":\"provided\",\"requirements_links_status\":\"complete\",\"_canonical_fingerprint\":\"f4d4b00693a39d1dd8df080febb47cb3800b071e0e6fb4dc756bf4f128bd2c22\",\"_submission_identity\":{\"group_id\":\"N02\",\"semester_id\":\"HK2627_1\",\"topic_id\":\"DT27\",\"stage_id\":1,\"round_id\":1},\"_analysis_history\":{\"86293da4fe110f5d998c516ec4b25c8c02f2f