":\\\"other\\\",\\\"source_ids\\\":[\\\"AI-005:0010\\\"],\\\"source_pages\\\":[40],\\\"evidence\\\":\\\"Quy tr\\u00ecnh giao ti\\u1ebfp gi\\u1eefa Client v\\u00e0 Server \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c th\\u1ef1c hi\\u1ec7n th\\u00f4ng qua c\\u01a1 ch\\u1ebf \\\\nRequest \\u2013 Response.\\\",\\\"source_references\\\":[{\\\"source_id\\\":\\\"AI-005:0010\\\",\\\"page\\\":40,\\\"end_page\\\":40,\\\"quote\\\":\\\"Quy tr\\u00ecnh giao ti\\u1ebfp gi\\u1eefa Client v\\u00e0 Server \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c th\\u1ef1c hi\\u1ec7n th\\u00f4ng qua c\\u01a1 ch\\u1ebf \\\\nRequest \\u2013 Response.\\\",\\\"start\\\":55217,\\\"end\\\":55311,\\\"quote_verified\\\":true,\\\"semantic_support\\\":\\\"NOT_VERIFIED\\\"}],\\\"verified\\\":true,\\\"relevance_verified\\\":false,\\\"semantic_support\\\":\\\"NOT_VERIFIED\\\"}],\\\"summary\\\":\\\"M\\u00f4 h\\u00ecnh Client-Server g\\u1ed3m ph\\u00eda kh\\u00e1ch thu th\\u1eadp d\\u1eef li\\u1ec7u, g\\u1eedi y\\u00eau c\\u1ea7u, hi\\u1ec3n th\\u1ecb giao di\\u1ec7n v\\u00e0 ph\\u00eda m\\u00e1y ch\\u1ee7 ti\\u1ebfp nh\\u1eadn y\\u00eau c\\u1ea7u, th\\u1ef1c thi logic nghi\\u1ec7p v\\u1ee5, qu\\u1ea3n l\\u00fd c\\u01a1 s\\u1edf d\\u1eef li\\u1ec7u. Nguy\\u00ean l\\u00fd ho\\u1ea1t \\u0111\\u1ed9ng c\\u1ee7a m\\u00f4 h\\u00ecnh Client-Server th\\u1ef1c hi\\u1ec7n theo c\\u01a1 ch\\u1ebf y\\u00eau c\\u1ea7u v\\u00e0 ph\\u1ea3n h\\u1ed3i. Client cung c\\u1ea5p giao di\\u1ec7n Web cho sinh vi\\u00ean, gi\\u1ea3ng vi\\u00ean v\\u00e0 c\\u00e1n b\\u1ed9 qu\\u1ea3n l\\u00fd th\\u1ef1c hi\\u1ec7n ch\\u1ee9c n\\u0103ng. Server x\\u1eed l\\u00fd nghi\\u1ec7p v\\u1ee5 qu\\u1ea3n l\\u00fd kh\\u00f3a lu\\u1eadn, x\\u00e1c th\\u1ef1c ng\\u01b0\\u1eddi d\\u00f9ng, k\\u1ebft n\\u1ed1i c\\u01a1 s\\u1edf d\\u1eef li\\u1ec7u MySQL v\\u00e0 t\\u00edch h\\u1ee3p h\\u1ec7 th\\u1ed1ng AI. MVC l\\u00e0 m\\u00f4 h\\u00ecnh ki\\u1ebfn tr\\u00fac ph\\u1ea7n m\\u1ec1m ph\\u00e2n chia \\u1ee9ng d\\u1ee5ng th\\u00e0nh Model, View v\\u00e0 Controller. Model ch\\u1ecbu tr\\u00e1ch nhi\\u1ec7m t\\u01b0\\u01a1ng t\\u00e1c tr\\u1ef1c ti\\u1ebfp v\\u1edbi h\\u1ec7 qu\\u1ea3n tr\\u1ecb c\\u01a1 s\\u1edf d\\u1eef li\\u1ec7u v\\u00e0 ch\\u1ee9a c\\u00e1c quy t\\u1eafc nghi\\u1ec7p v\\u1ee5. View l\\u00e0 l\\u1edbp giao di\\u1ec7n ng\\u01b0\\u1eddi d\\u00f9ng \\u0111\\u1ea3m nhi\\u1ec7m t\\u1ed5 ch\\u1ee9c v\\u00e0 hi\\u1ec3n th\\u1ecb d\\u1eef li\\u1ec7u t\\u1eeb Model. Controller ti\\u1ebfp nh\\u1eadn y\\u00eau c\\u1ea7u t\\u1eeb ng\\u01b0\\u1eddi d\\u00f9ng th\\u00f4ng qua View, g\\u1ecdi Model \\u0111\\u1ec3 l\\u1ea5y ho\\u1eb7c c\\u1eadp nh\\u1eadt d\\u1eef li\\u1ec7u v\\u00e0 quy\\u1ebft \\u0111\\u1ecbnh View hi\\u1ec3n th\\u1ecb k\\u1ebft qu\\u1ea3. Quy tr\\u00ecnh giao ti\\u1ebfp gi\\u1eefa Client v\\u00e0 Server \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c th\\u1ef1c hi\\u1ec7n th\\u00f4ng qua c\\u01a1 ch\\u1ebf Request \\u2013 Response.\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"completed\\\",\\\"related_assets\\\":[],\\\"sections\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"s00030\\\",\\\"number\\\":\\\"2.1.1\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"M\\u00f4 h\\u00ecnh Client \\u2013 Server\\\",\\\"level\\\":4,\\\"kind\\\":\\\"section\\\",\\\"start_page\\\":38,\\\"end_page\\\":39,\\\"items\\\":[{\\\"content\\\":\\\"M\\u00f4 h\\u00ecnh Client-Server g\\u1ed3m ph\\u00eda kh\\u00e1ch thu th\\u1eadp d\\u1eef li\\u1ec7u, g\\u1eedi y\\u00eau c\\u1ea7u, hi\\u1ec3n th\\u1ecb giao di\\u1ec7n v\\u00e0 ph\\u00eda m\\u00e1y ch\\u1ee7 ti\\u1ebfp nh\\u1eadn y\\u00eau c\\u1ea7u, th\\u1ef1c thi logic nghi\\u1ec7p v\\u1ee5, qu\\u1ea3n l\\u00fd c\\u01a1 s\\u1edf d\\u1eef li\\u1ec7u.\\\",\\\"kind\\\":\\\"other\\\",\\\"source_ids\\\":[\\\"AI-005:0002\\\"],\\\"source_pages\\\":[38],\\\"evidence\\\":\\\"\\u2022 \\\\nClient (Ph\\u00eda kh\\u00e1ch): Thu th\\u1eadp d\\u1eef li\\u1ec7u \\u0111\\u1ea7u v\\u00e0o, g\\u1eedi y\\u00eau c\\u1ea7u, hi\\u1ec3n th\\u1ecb giao \\\\ndi\\u1ec7n UI (Browser, Mobile App). \\\\n\\u2022 \\\\nServer (Ph\\u00eda m\\u00e1y ch\\u1ee7): Ti\\u1ebfp nh\\u1eadn y\\u00eau c\\u1ea7u, th\\u1ef1c thi logic nghi\\u1ec7p v\\u1ee